UID:day-2026-11-19@eurotrip2026
SUMMARY:Munique — chegada - EuroTrip 2026
DESCRIPTION:Chegada ~13h30 (KLM) · sem saída 09:00\\n13:30–16:00 - MUC → S8/S1 → Hbf
 (~40 min) → hotel check-in / bagagem\\n16:00–18:30 - Marienplatz → Neues
 Rathaus (fachada) → Frauenkirche (exterior) → Viktualienmarkt (snack)\\n
 18:30–21:00 - U-Bahn/S-Bahn hotel → Karlsplatz (Stachus) (~5 min) · pass
 eio leve 30 min (est.) · volta Hbf · jantar REWE ou McDonald’s Hbf · dor
 mir cedo (jet lag)
LOCATION:Munique — chegada
CATEGORIES:Dia
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTSTAMP:20261110T110539Z
END:VEVENT
