BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day-2026-11-21@eurotrip2026
SUMMARY:Munique — Füssen a pé + Neuschwanstein - EuroTrip 2026
DESCRIPTION:Sem noite · Füssen\\n07:30–07:45 - Café simples e mochila leve\; sair sem
 despachar bagagem.\\n07:45 - Hotel → München ZOB para embarque.\\n08:00–
 10:15 - FlixBus München ZOB → Füssen Kemptener Str.\; não confundir com
 a parada de volta.\\n10:15–11:45 - Tour Historic Center · Tourist Info ·
 ~1h30 — 5 paradas (~1h30) · 1ª Reichenstraße → últ. Lech / Marktplatz ·
 subhorários no expandir\\n11:45–12:15 - Tourist Info → parada do ônibus
 73/78 → Hohenschwangau.\\n12:15–15:00 - Hohenschwangau → Neuschwanstein
 → Marienbrücke\; lanche do kit.\\n15:00–15:45 - Descida → 73/78 → caminh
 ada até Pulverturm.\\n16:00–18:00 - FlixBus Pulverturm → München ZOB\; n
 ão planejar passeio na chegada.\\n18:00–19:30 - Jantar leve e mala para
 Salzburgo\; dormir cedo.
LOCATION:Munique — Füssen a pé + Neuschwanstein
CATEGORIES:Dia
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTSTAMP:20261110T110539Z
